perates as a general contractor to provide all the additional necessary parts to deliver clients' projects, from the initial estimate and bid process, to subcontractor selection, and management of all construction details. The company was formerly known as urban-gro, Inc. and changed its name to Flash Sports & Media Holdings, Inc. in June 2026. Flash Sports & Media Holdings, Inc. was founded in 2014 and is based in Lafayette, Colorado."}}